          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Premium Fabric Feel",
            "heading_size": "hxl"
          }
        },
        "text_image_third": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>You've felt it before — a rubber band rolling up your thigh mid-squat, pinching your skin, killing your focus right when you need it most. You readjust. You lose the rep. You lose the burn.</strong></p><p><strong><br/>Made from premium woven fabrib ( not rubber, not latex ) our bands feel soft against your skin from the first rep to the last. No pinching. No digging. No rolling. Just smooth, consistent resistance that lets you stay locked into your workout instead of fighting your equipment.<br/><br/>The wide non-slip grip keeps the band exactly where you placed it — through hip thrusts, squats, kickbacks, lateral walks, and everything in between. No adjusting. No slipping. No excuses.<br/><br/>Compact enough for your gym bag, durable enough to outlast every cheap rubber set you've tried before. GluteLoom bands go wherever your workout takes you — at home, at the gym, or on the road.</strong></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
